{"id": 7417, "name": "Buena Vista RV Park", "read": "2026-10-16", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.buenavistarvpark.org/buena-vista-rv-park/overview", "lines": []}, {"url": "https://www.buenavistarvpark.org/buena-vista-rv-park/Overview", "lines": [], "via": "Overview"}, {"url": "https://www.buenavistarvpark.org/buena-vista-rv-park/Rates", "lines": [], "via": "Rates"}, {"url": "https://www.buenavistarvpark.org/buena-vista-rv-park/Map", "lines": [], "via": "Map"}, {"url": "https://www.buenavistarvpark.org/buena-vista-rv-park/Facilities", "lines": ["e sure to appreciate our warm temperatures and sunny skies! We are capable of receiving tenters, (single or in a group). If you're a bicycler, you may want to make our park one of your destinations to stay the night. At $7.50 per person per night, that's not a bad deal. Considering all that is covered: an affordable, safe, lighted space, that's level, on soft sand, with electricity and water, plus that provides acces", "the mail center, and free trash. The laundry facility has two washers and two dryers ... all reasonably priced! | | At Buena Vista RV Park is open year-round. We offer reasonable daily, weekly, and monthly rates: (daily $50), (weekly $250), and ($475 monthly plus electricity). There is a refundable deposit, on the monthly rate, of $150. The 'monthly rates are figured on a 2-person, 2 pet, and 2 vehicle occupancy. The", "(weekly $250), and ($475 monthly plus electricity). There is a refundable deposit, on the monthly rate, of $150. The 'monthly rates are figured on a 2-person, 2 pet, and 2 vehicle occupancy. There is a monthly charge of $65 for any additional adults and/or children over the age of 9; and there is an additional $35 charge for each additional vehicle. | | Buena Vista RV Park is a peaceful, quiet, family friendly park. "], "via": "Facilities"}]}
